{"quest_id": 4195, "name": "諸刃の力", "description": "出現した魔物は王子を誘う罠だった！\n暗黒騎士団との戦いが再び始まる。\n\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "暗黒騎士団の最期", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920033, "map_no": 3530, "level": 95, "multiplier": 0.95, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 9, "form_count": 1, "hp": 608, "attack": 133, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_count": 1, "hp": 950, "attack": 142, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 26}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4750, "attack": 380, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9, "spawn_sec": 44}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "hp": 608, "base_hp": 640, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 65, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 650.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097216, "master_id": 4, "spawn_sec": 48}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 19000, "attack": 760, "base_hp": 20000, "base_attack": 800, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 600, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 201, "move_speed": 150.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2104016, "special_effect_id": 347, "master_id": 20002, "global_id": 1077, "spawn_sec": 76}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 4, "level": 80, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 2660, "attack": 380, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 58, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 127, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097264, "master_id": 7, "spawn_sec": 102}], "popups": ["暗黒騎士団長がいる間は\n味方の攻撃力が５分の１になります。\n倒すか拠点に到達すると\n攻撃力は通常の数値に戻ります。\n\nまた、暗黒の力の影響で団長自身の体力は\n徐々に減少し、いずれ自滅します。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "兵士", "text": "新たな敵影を確認！\nあ……暗黒騎士団です！！", "face": "lcc130fd78bb7"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "暗黒騎士団……。\nまたしても私たちの前に……！", "face": "lefb1d0ba9c6a"}, {"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "フハハハハハハ！！\n王子よ。貴様との決着をつけに来たぞ。", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}, {"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "魔物たちよ！　行け！！\nやつの首を取れえ！！", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 79, "lines": [{"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "王子よ！　我が相手だ！！", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}, {"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "貴様らの攻撃力を奪う\n我が放つ暗黒の波動を打ち破ることができるかな？", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}, {"name": "副団長", "text": "（これほどの波動の強さ、\n反動が凄まじいはず。\nこのままじゃ団長の身体は……っ）", "face": "ld30285a1a287"}, {"name": "副団長", "text": "団長！　このままだと波動が強すぎて、\n先にあんたの身体がもたなくなる！\n急いで決着をつけないと！", "face": "ld30285a1a287"}, {"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "我の身が持たぬことなど、\nとっくに承知の上よ……！！", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "ぐぬぬぬ……。", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}, {"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "勝てぬ……。\nなぜだ……なぜなのだ……。", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}, {"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "ぐああああ！！！\n身体が…カラダガアアア！！", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}, {"name": "副団長", "text": "波動の力に体が耐え切れず、崩壊が始まったのね。\n無茶するから……っ。", "face": "ld30285a1a287"}, {"name": "副団長", "text": "ここはいったん引いたほうがいいかもね。\nアタシたちに暗黒の力を授けてくれた\n「あのお方」の所へ向かいましょう。", "face": "ld30285a1a287"}, {"name": "暗黒騎士", "text": "ぐっ……。\n仕方ないが、そうするほかないようだ……。", "face": "l10aac96d9b2c"}]}], "active": true}